{
  "basis": "The dashboard displays a scatterplot of 'Top Regions' showing a positive descriptive association between advertising spend and sales for five specific regions (A-E). However, the chart lacks cost data to calculate ROI, contains no time-series data to establish causality or trends, and only covers a subset of regions. The page instructions require reviewing dashboard evidence to submit an 'approval or evidence-review decision.' Because the available evidence is insufficient to support a 'broader ad budget expansion' (which would require proof of profitability or causal impact), the supported public option is to hold and request the missing full regional data analysis.",
  "option_label": "Select \"Hold and request full regional data analysis\""
}
